ecConfigSchema`, `ResolvedKspecConfig`, defaults, and resolution logic.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] 2 new behavioral tests for AC-11 in `shadow.test.ts` (integration + conflict scenarios)\n- [x] 5 new tests for AC-12 in `shadow-sync-scheduler.test.ts` (interval=0 noop, start/stop, syncOnce pulls, no-tracking skip, concurrent guard)\n- [x] All 101 shadow tests pass\n- [x] All 68 config tests pass\n- [x] TypeScript compiles cleanly\n- [x] Full test shards pass (pre-existing codex failures only)\n\nTask: @01KK6BECKPA5MHQAZJ2KNPEMP1\nSpec: @config-shadow\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-03-08T11:09:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T14:58:22Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9796d177c22ded85fe589bcb21942f23fc6b85f3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pulls/712/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pulls/712/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/issues/712/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/statuses/0633647de42cafd70f1202d774aa269d6a2d7782","head":{"label":"kynetic-ai:feat/bidirectional-shadow-sync","ref":"feat/bidirectional-shadow-sync","sha":"0633647de42cafd70f1202d774aa269d6a2d7782","user":{"login":"kynetic-ai","id":255431765,"node_id":"O_kgDODzmUVQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255431765?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kynetic-ai","html_url":"https://github.com/kynetic-ai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kynetic-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kynetic-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kynetic-ai/gists{/gist_id}","